OL,5,G0900 Couples Come Dine with Me
OL,6,     FIn Portsmouth, there's organic
OL,7,     Ffare, glitter and sparkle, and
OL,8,     Fsome school dinner comparisons, as
OL,9,     Fthree couples compete to host the
OL,10,     Fbest dinner party.
OL,11,G1000 Couples Come Dine with Me
OL,12,     FCarl and Brianha bring the French
OL,13,     FRiviera to Bognor Regis, with
OL,14,     Flasers and a smoke machine. Justin
OL,15,     Fand Karen do fine dining. And is
OL,16,     FMark and Lisa's curry too hot for
OL,17,     Ftheir guests to handle?
