OL,5,G1100 Storage Wars: Texas
OL,6,     FWith a flick of her hair and a
OL,7,     Fflutter of her eyelashes, Jenny
OL,8,     Freckons she can score a win in
OL,9,     FFort Worth. But Bubba's
OL,10,     Fimmediately pegged her for a
OL,11,     F'shameless flirt'.
OL,12,G1130 Storage Wars: Texas
OL,13,     FA storm is brewing - namely
OL,14,     Fbecause Lesa's back. And she's
OL,15,     Fready to pick up where she left
OL,16,     Foff with old enemy Victor. But
OL,17,     Fperhaps she didn't count on making
OL,18,     Fsome new ones, too...
